{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17903","headline":"中和节诏赐公卿尺 · 裴度","name":"中和节诏赐公卿尺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳和行庆赐，尺度及羣公。\n荷宠承佳节，倾心立大中。\n短长思合制，远近贵攸同。\n共仰财成德，将酬分寸功。\n作程施有政，垂范播无穷。\n愿续南山寿，千春奉圣躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}